# This package verifies its data by SHA-256 over exact bytes, so git must never
# convert line endings on checkout. Without this, cloning on a machine with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites every LF to CRLF and corpora/*.sha256 fails for all
# 100 synthetic graphs, while the same clone on Linux or macOS passes - a check
# that depends on the reviewer's platform is worse than no check.
* -text
